<headline>IPO FILING-EPIX Medical Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		 EPIX Medical Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			  EPIX.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $9-$11/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    2.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 2.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    8,314,747</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    Hambrecht &amp; Quist</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  300,000 shrs Business: The Cambridge, Mass., company is developing targeted contrast agents both to improve the capability and expand the use of magnetic resonance imaging as a diagnostic tool for a variety of diseases.</p>
